      "returnType": "PrettyWriter&",
      "docs": "! \\param indentChar       Character for indentation. Must be whitespace character (' ', '\\\\t', '\\\\n', '\\\\r').\n\\param indentCharCount  Number of indent characters for each indentation level.\n\\note The default indentation is 4 spaces."
